 971  SET
 972   SIREC(AC)              set for elements permitted to receive payment from S-I
 973   NEGCELL(AC,ACP)        the SAM payment from ACP (column) to AC (row) is negative
 974   LARGECELL(AC,ACP)      cells with absolute values larger than cellcutoffup
 975   SMALLCELL(AC,ACP)      cells with absolute values smaller than cellcutofflo
 976   SHRITEM                items for which shares and cutoffs are defined /
 977    FAC                   factor in activity
 978    VA                    value-added
 979    EXP                   exports
 980    IMP                   imports
 981   /
 982  ;
 983   
 984  PARAMETER
 985   ERRSAMFLOW(AC,ACP)     if UNDF -- illegal SAM payment from 2nd index to 1st
 986   ERREXPOUT(C)           if UNDF -- exports exceed domestic output for comm c
 987   SAMGAPCUTOFF           max acceptable abs gap bt model SAM row and col totals
 988   ERRSAMBAL(AC)          if UNDF -- the absolute imbalance for AC exceeds cutoff
 989   MAXCELL                maximum absolute cell value in SAM (excluding totals)
 990   MINCELL                minimum absolute non-zero cell value in SAM
 991   cellcutoffup           absolute cell values above cutoff are displayed as large
 992   cellcutofflo           absolute cell values below cutoff are displayed as small
 993   ACTFACSHR(F,A)         small share of factor f in total value-added of activity a
 994   ACTVASHR(AC)            small share of activity a in total economywide value-added
 995   EXPSHR(C)              small share of exports in total output of commodity c
 996   IMPSHR(C)              small share of imports in total domestic demand for commodity c
 997   SHRCUTOFF(SHRITEM)     upper limit for shares values that are displayed
 998   ERRHOME(A,H)           act with home cons comm shares not summing to one
 999   ERRQFBASE1(F,A)        demand specified for factor but no SAM payment
1000   ERRQFBASE2(F,A)        demands specified but missing for f-a combination in SAM
1001   ERRTRADE(C,EF)         commodities with missing trade elas
1002   ERRPROD1(A)            activities with missing factor substitut elas
1003   ERRPROD2(A)            CES activities with missing agg va - intermed elas
1004   ERRAC(C)               commodities with missing domestic aggregation elas
1005   ERRLES1(C,H)           marketed commodities with missing hhd cons elas
1006   ERRLES2(A,C,H)         home comm's with shrhome but missing hhd cons elas
1007  ;
