2960   
2961  *Setup reporting parameters
INCLUDE    C:\Users\EARAGIE\IFPRI Dropbox\Emerta Aragie\Rwanda MINECOFIN-GIZ project 2026\4 CGE model (Rwanda)\includes\static\stat_repsetup.inc
2964   
      PART 2.3: Declare reporting parameters
       This include file (includes\2static_repsetup.inc) creates parameters used to store results within
       the simulation loop after each solve (see includes\2static_reploop.inc). Note: All other results 
       parameters are declared and defined in the standard reporting file (includes\2static_report.inc).
       
      SECTIONS:
       2.3.1  Sets for internal reporting parameters
       2.3.2  Parameters for storing post-solution variable values
2975   
2976   
2977  *------------------------------------------------------------------
2978  *2.3.1  Sets for internal reporting parameters
2979  *------------------------------------------------------------------
2980   
2981  SETS
2982   SAC            SAM account categories /
2983    ACT           actitivities
2984    COM           commodities
2985    FAC           factors
2986    INSDNG        domestic nongovernment institutions
2987    GOV           government
2988    SAVINV        savings-investments
2989    INSTAX        direct taxes on institutions
2990    FACTAX        direct taxes on factors
2991    VATTAX        value added tax
2992    ACTTAX        tax on activity gross revenue
2993    COMTAX        tax on commodity sales in the domestic market
2994    IMPTAX        import tariff
2995    EXPTAX        export tax
2996    ROW           rest of world (FCU)
2997   /
2998   IND3           third index for SAM budgets     / INC, SPND, GAP /
2999   KGDP           first index in GDP tables       / NOMINAL, REAL, NOMSHARE, REALSHARE, DEFLATOR /
3000   IGDP           items for GDP and national accounts  /
3001    ABSORP        absorption
3002    PRVCON        private consumption
3003    FIXINV        fixed investment
3004    DSTOCK        stock change
3005    GOVCON        government consumption
